---- MODULE space_unassigned__branch__plain ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLES x, y
vars == <<x, y>>
Assign(a, b) == x = a /\ y = b
Same(a, b) == a = a /\ b = b
Init == x = 0
Next == x' \in {x} /\ (y' = y \/ y' = y)

